    "answer": {
      "short": "$279\\text{ cm}^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\text{Small rectangle height}&=9-2.5=6.5\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Large base}&=16\\times1.5=24\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Large rectangle height}&=6.5\\times1.5=9.75\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Large roof height}&=2.5\\times1.5=3.75\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Rectangle area}&=24\\times9.75=234\\text{ cm}^2\\\\\\text{Roof area}&=\\tfrac12\\times24\\times3.75=45\\text{ cm}^2\\\\\\text{Total area}&=234+45=279\\text{ cm}^2\\end{aligned}$$",
